<title>UK: Saville sells unit to British Fittings.</title>
<headline>Saville sells unit to British Fittings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's J. Saville Gordon Plc said on Monday it was selling its pipeline equipment stockholding business for a total of 6.37 million stg to British Fittings Plc.</p>
<p>&quot;This sale represents the virtual completion of the company's transformation into a focused property investment and development company,&quot; said chairman John Saville.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it would receieve cash and shares for the sale of J. Saville Gordon (Tubes &amp; Fitting) Ltd.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
